WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.975
Section 2.

00:00:01.925 --> 00:00:05.012
The Medical Assistance in Dying Question.

00:00:05.012 --> 00:00:12.562
Veterans who called seeking assistance for injuries sustained in service were systematically offered state-sponsored euthanasia.

00:00:12.562 --> 00:00:17.400
No veteran should ever be offered death when they are asking for help to live.
